diff --git a/changelog/3401.bugfix.rst b/changelog/3401.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..b81ae4ad
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/3401.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed a bug where the ``verify_mode`` of the connection's ``ssl_context`` was applied
+to the proxy TLS connection, making it impossible to verify the proxy certificate with
+``proxy_ssl_context`` while disabling verification for the proxied connection.
